response_text:
This enterprise-grade, modular Secure File Transfer Protocol (SFTP) Server is implemented in C# using .NET 8. It features modern cryptographic primitives, a highly secure Virtual File System (VFS) with robust path-traversal mitigations, a native SFTP packet parser/serializer, and an asynchronous, audit-logging engine with real-time transfer metric calculations and SHA256 file integrity hashing.

### Architecture Overview

```
                      +----------------------------------------+
                      |          TCP Connection Pool           |
                      +----------------------------------------+
                                          |
                                          v
                      +----------------------------------------+
                      |     SSH Transport Layer Security       |
                      |  (KEX, Cipher Negotiation, RSA/ECDH)  |
                      +----------------------------------------+
                                          |
                                          v
                      +----------------------------------------+
                      |         SFTP Protocol Engine           |
                      |   (State Machine, Packet Serialization)|
                      +----------------------------------------+
                                          |
                                          v
                      +----------------------------------------+
                      |     Virtual File System (VFS)          |
                      |   (Sandboxed Paths, Chroot Engine)     |
                      +----------------------------------------+
                                          |
                                          v
                      +----------------------------------------+
                      |        Audit & Metrics Engine          |
                      |  (Throughput, Latency, SHA-256 Hashes) |
                      +----------------------------------------+
```

